+# b) Complexity calibration
+#    - The generator restricts the number of non-anchor pieces to 4 or 6. That
+#      gives 2 or 3 synchronous stages, which is large enough to make the two-arm
+#      pattern visible but small enough to keep the red-pair search unique.
+#    - Every non-anchor piece has either one port pair (leaf) or two opposite port
+#      pairs (internal chain segment). This removes branching hubs that would hide
